  "description": {
    "text": "Battle Road Spring 2007 held nine lottery-entry tournaments at seven venues across Japan from 17 March to 8 April 2007. Every entrant got a Pikachu and a Gible promo, each holding an Oran Berry; finalists won the cosmos holo Supporter Bebe's Search, and the top three of each division Mysterious Pearl, the new trophy card named in homage to the Diamond and Pearl games, in an acrylic shield case. Each division's winner was invited to the 2007 World Championships. Side events gave cosmos holo cards too: Armor Fossil and Skull Fossil to everyone in the Diamond vs. Pearl One Day Battle, and Time-Space Distortion to the winning teams of Team Battle DP.",
